# Contents excluded from the Docker build context.
#
# IMPORTANT: the builder stage runs `COPY . .` AFTER `npm ci`, so anything left
# in the context would be copied over the freshly installed dependencies. Without
# this file the host `node_modules/` and `.next/` shadow the image's own copies.

# Dependencies (installed inside the image by the `deps` stage)
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output (rebuilt inside the image by `npm run build`)
.next
out
build
dist

# Version control / ignore files
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# Local environment / secrets — NEXT_PUBLIC_* are passed as build args, not files
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# Test / coverage / type-check artifacts
coverage
.nyc_output
junit.xml
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local tooling / editor state
.idea
.vscode
*.log
.DS_Store
